WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.226
"Hi! I'm a 3rd-year CSE student, preparing

00:00:02.226 --> 00:00:03.026
for placements..."

00:00:04.466 --> 00:00:05.213
Sound familiar?

00:00:05.213 --> 00:00:06.263
You've typed that intro...

00:00:06.263 --> 00:00:07.838
a hundred times.

00:00:08.751 --> 00:00:09.564
And every time...

00:00:09.564 --> 00:00:11.176
it says: "Nice to meet you!"

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:13.124
47 tabs.

00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:14.574
Zero context.

00:00:14.751 --> 00:00:16.517
It doesn't know you cracked two-pointers last

00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:17.430
night.

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.509
It doesn't know your project broke at

00:00:19.509 --> 00:00:20.909
checkpoint three.

00:00:21.609 --> 00:00:22.474
It doesn't know anything.

00:00:22.474 --> 00:00:24.024
So... it guesses.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.713
Placiq fixes that...

00:00:25.713 --> 00:00:26.525
with PCME.

00:00:26.525 --> 00:00:28.275
Persistent Context Memory.

00:00:29.323 --> 00:00:29.817
Your strengths.

00:00:29.817 --> 00:00:30.417
Your mistakes.

00:00:30.417 --> 00:00:31.129
Your progress.

00:00:31.129 --> 00:00:32.979
Stitched into one memory.

00:00:33.609 --> 00:00:35.561
So your Placement Copilot opens with you.

00:00:35.561 --> 00:00:36.961
Not with zero.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.390
Ask what to fix next...

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.627
and get an answer built on your

00:00:39.627 --> 00:00:40.990
actual work.

00:00:41.323 --> 00:00:41.841
Your readiness.

00:00:41.841 --> 00:00:42.366
Your quests.

00:00:42.366 --> 00:00:43.704
Your next move.

00:00:43.894 --> 00:00:45.810
Your AI doesn't start from zero anymore.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:46.473
It starts...

00:00:46.473 --> 00:00:47.498
from you.

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:51.180
Placiq. Stop repeating yourself.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:51.655
learn.placiq.in
